  "details": "I have a camera uploaded to the model under the Extra folder with the toggle just called Cam. The camera Culling Mask is Pickup, and MirrorReflection. This makes it show the model in the VRChat window on the bottom right. When turning on Steadycam in VR and the Open Beta, it does not show anymore. Doing this in the live build (1856) makes the camera show as intended even when Steadycam is on.\n\nAvatar ID: avtr_cfc8b526-c555-4120-b40d-99fbac7cd43f",
